        "statement": "Let $P$ be admissible and stationary in the sense of @def-stationary-polygon. If $u>0$ is the $L^2$-normalized first eigenfunction, $\\lambda=\\lambda_1(P)$, $c=\\lambda/A(P)$, and $q=|\\partial_\\nu u|^2$, then every effective edge $E$, parametrized by physical arclength $s\\in[0,\\ell_E]$, satisfies\n$$\n\\int_E(q-c)\\,ds=0,\\qquad \\int_Es(q-c)\\,ds=0.\n$$",
