      "kind": "lemma",
      "title": "Regular polygon spectral asymptotic",
      "statement": "For the unit-area regular $M$-gon in @def-j-functional,\n$$\n\\frac{J(R_M)}{\\pi j^2}=1+\\frac{4\\zeta(3)}{M^3}+O(M^{-9/2})\n\\quad (M\\to\\infty).\n$$",
